{"seq":1,"slug":"format-targets","title":"不同载体母带","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/mastering/delivery/format-targets","wordCount":1568,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"不同载体母带\">不同载体母带</h1><p>母带处理到了交付环节，会遇到一个许多人忽视的事实：不存在&quot;一个母版通吃所有载体&quot;。流媒体、CD、黑胶、磁带，每种载体的物理与技术约束都不同——流媒体要防 AAC 编码削波，CD 是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>16</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">16</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">16</span></span></span></span></span>-bit/<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>44.1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">44.1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">44.1</span></span></span></span></span> kHz 的硬规格，黑胶受唱针物理运动限制，磁带有自己的频响与饱和特性。专业母带工程师通常从一份&quot;母带主版&quot;出发，针对每种载体做必要的微调，导出多份各自达标的成品。理解每种载体要什么、怕什么，是交付不翻车的前提。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>不同载体对母带的要求，可以归结为三组参数：位深/采样率、峰值/响度策略、以及载体特有的物理约束。下图展示从一份母带主版分发到各载体的流程：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[母带主版&lt;br/&gt;高分辨率 24-bit] --&gt; B{目标载体?}&#10;  B --&gt;|流媒体| C[24-bit WAV&lt;br/&gt;-1 dBTP, 不抖动到16bit]&#10;  B --&gt;|CD| D[16-bit/44.1kHz&lt;br/&gt;抖动 + DDP]&#10;  B --&gt;|黑胶| E[预母带&lt;br/&gt;低频归中, 收齿音]&#10;  B --&gt;|磁带| F[适配磁带频响/饱和]&#10;  C --&gt; G[各载体成品]&#10;  D --&gt; G&#10;  E --&gt; G&#10;  F --&gt; G\">flowchart TD\n  A[母带主版&lt;br/&gt;高分辨率 24-bit] --&gt; B{目标载体?}\n  B --&gt;|流媒体| C[24-bit WAV&lt;br/&gt;-1 dBTP, 不抖动到16bit]\n  B --&gt;|CD| D[16-bit/44.1kHz&lt;br/&gt;抖动 + DDP]\n  B --&gt;|黑胶| E[预母带&lt;br/&gt;低频归中, 收齿音]\n  B --&gt;|磁带| F[适配磁带频响/饱和]\n  C --&gt; G[各载体成品]\n  D --&gt; G\n  E --&gt; G\n  F --&gt; G</pre><p>下表把主流载体的关键规格并列：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>载体</th>\n<th>位深 / 采样率</th>\n<th>峰值策略</th>\n<th>特有约束</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>流媒体</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>24</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">24</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">24</span></span></span></span></span>-bit，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>44.1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">44.1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">44.1</span></span></span></span></span>/<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>48</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">48</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">48</span></span></span></span></span> kHz</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≤</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\le -1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> dBTP</td>\n<td>防 AAC/MP3 编码削波</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CD</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>16</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">16</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">16</span></span></span></span></span>-bit，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>44.1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">44.1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">44.1</span></span></span></span></span> kHz（硬性）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≤</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>0.3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\le -0.3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">0.3</span></span></span></span></span> dBFS（常）</td>\n<td>必须抖动、需 DDP</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>黑胶</td>\n<td>高分辨率预母带</td>\n<td>留更多余量</td>\n<td>低频归中、收齿音、内圈失真</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>磁带</td>\n<td>高分辨率源</td>\n<td>适配磁头</td>\n<td>自然饱和、高频损失</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"流媒体-为编码留余量\">流媒体：为编码留余量</h2><p>流媒体是 2026 年绝大多数音乐的主战场。它的母带要点在前面的章节已多次铺垫，这里收束成交付规范：以 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>24</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">24</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">24</span></span></span></span></span>-bit、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>44.1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">44.1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">44.1</span></span></span></span></span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>48</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">48</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">48</span></span></span></span></span> kHz 的高分辨率 WAV 交付（不要降到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>16</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">16</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">16</span></span></span></span></span>-bit，平台自己会转码，给它更高分辨率的源更好）；真峰值守在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≤</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\le -1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> dBTP，给后续 AAC/MP3 编码的内部采样峰值留出余量（机制见<a href=\"../dynamics-loudness/compression-limiting\">压缩与限制</a>）；集成响度按风格设定，不必逐平台单做，因为主流平台已收敛到约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>14</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-14</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">14</span></span></span></span></span> LUFS（详见<a href=\"../dynamics-loudness/lufs-loudness\">响度标准 LUFS</a>）。</p>\n<p>关键纪律：交付给流媒体的高分辨率文件<strong>不做抖动</strong>（dither），因为抖动只在&quot;降低位深&quot;那一刻才有意义，而你交付的是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>24</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">24</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">24</span></span></span></span></span>-bit 源、并未降位。抖动的正确归宿是 CD 的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>16</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">16</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">16</span></span></span></span></span>-bit 转换。</p>\n<p>来源：<a href=\"https://www.izotope.com/en/learn/mastering-for-streaming-platforms\">iZotope: Mastering for streaming</a>、<a href=\"https://theproaudiofiles.com/audio-mastering-format-and-delivery-guide-2014/\">ProAudioFiles 2026 格式与交付指南</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"cd-抖动与-16-bit-的硬约束\">CD：抖动与 16-bit 的硬约束</h2><p>尽管 CD 销量大幅下滑，它仍是有形发行（实体专辑、媒体送审）的标准载体，且它的技术规格毫无弹性：必须是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>16</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">16</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">16</span></span></span></span></span>-bit、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>44.1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">44.1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">44.1</span></span></span></span></span> kHz、立体声 PCM。</p>\n<p>从母带主版的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>24</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">24</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">24</span></span></span></span></span>-bit 降到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>16</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">16</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">16</span></span></span></span></span>-bit，会丢掉 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span></span></span></span></span> 个比特的精度。如果直接截断，安静段落（如尾音消失处）会产生可闻的&quot;量化失真&quot;——一种颗粒状的杂音。抖动（dither）通过在降位前加入精心设计的极低电平噪声，把量化误差从&quot;相关失真&quot;转化为&quot;无相关的微弱噪声底&quot;，从而在感知上消除颗粒感。这是降位的最后一步，也是为什么<a href=\"../foundations/mastering-chain\">母带信号链</a>把抖动放在链路的最末端。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[24-bit 母带主版] --&gt; B{直接截断到 16-bit?}&#10;  B --&gt;|是| C[量化失真&lt;br/&gt;安静段颗粒杂音]&#10;  B --&gt;|先抖动再降位| D[误差转为微弱噪声底&lt;br/&gt;感知无颗粒]&#10;  D --&gt; E[16-bit/44.1kHz PCM]&#10;  E --&gt; F[封装为 DDP 镜像]\">flowchart TD\n  A[24-bit 母带主版] --&gt; B{直接截断到 16-bit?}\n  B --&gt;|是| C[量化失真&lt;br/&gt;安静段颗粒杂音]\n  B --&gt;|先抖动再降位| D[误差转为微弱噪声底&lt;br/&gt;感知无颗粒]\n  D --&gt; E[16-bit/44.1kHz PCM]\n  E --&gt; F[封装为 DDP 镜像]</pre><p>CD 交付的成品形态通常是 DDP（Disc Description Protocol）镜像——一种把全部音频、曲目标记、CD-Text、ISRC、UPC 等打包的标准格式，压片厂据此精确复制（DDP 与元数据细节见<a href=\"metadata-deliverables\">元数据与交付规范</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"黑胶与磁带-物理介质的脾气\">黑胶与磁带：物理介质的脾气</h2><p>黑胶（vinyl）近年复兴，但它对母带有一套独特的&quot;脾气&quot;，源于唱针在沟槽里的物理运动：</p>\n<p>第一，<strong>低频必须归中</strong>。沟槽水平方向编码 M、垂直方向编码 S，过宽的低频会让唱针垂直跳动过大导致跳针，所以低频归中几乎是强制的（机制见<a href=\"../spectral/stereo-space\">立体声与空间</a>）。第二，<strong>收敛齿音和极高频</strong>：刻纹机对强烈的高频能量（尤其 S 声道的齿音）很敏感，过量会刻不进沟槽。第三，<strong>内圈失真</strong>：唱片越靠内圈，线速度越低，高频细节越难保真——所以排序时常把动态大、高频亮的曲子放在每面外圈（这把交付与<a href=\"sequencing-spacing\">序列与曲间</a>联系起来）。第四，<strong>留更多余量</strong>：黑胶不追求流媒体那样的响度，给刻纹留出动态余量反而更好声。</p>\n<p>磁带（tape）作为小众但有市场的载体，则有它自己的频响曲线与磁饱和特性——交付高分辨率源、并理解磁带会自然柔化瞬态、损失一些极高频，是为它母带的要点。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>载体</th>\n<th>必做</th>\n<th>避免</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>黑胶</td>\n<td>低频归中、收齿音、按位置排序</td>\n<td>追求流媒体响度、过宽低频</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>磁带</td>\n<td>交付高分辨率源</td>\n<td>假设它和数字一样平直</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"从一份主版到多份成品\">从一份主版到多份成品</h2><p>把这些载体规格统一起来看，最佳实践是&quot;一份高分辨率母带主版 + 按载体微调&quot;。主版用最高分辨率（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>24</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">24</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">24</span></span></span></span></span>-bit 或更高）、保留充足动态；然后：流媒体从主版导 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>24</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">24</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">24</span></span></span></span></span>-bit WAV、不抖动；CD 从主版抖动降位到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>16</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">16</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">16</span></span></span></span></span>-bit 再封 DDP；黑胶从主版做低频归中、收齿音的预母带；磁带交付高分辨率源。这样既保证了每种载体各自达标，又避免了&quot;为流媒体压扁的版本被错误地送去刻黑胶&quot;这类灾难。</p>\n<p>这份主版的元数据（ISRC、UPC、曲目信息）和各载体的交付清单如何组织，是<a href=\"metadata-deliverables\">元数据与交付规范</a>的主题；而专辑内部曲目顺序、面的划分、曲间留白，则由<a href=\"sequencing-spacing\">序列与曲间</a>统管。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>不存在通吃的母版：流媒体、CD、黑胶、磁带各有物理与技术约束，最佳实践是&quot;一份高分辨率主版 + 按载体微调&quot;。</li>\n<li>流媒体：交付 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>24</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">24</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">24</span></span></span></span></span>-bit 高分辨率 WAV、不抖动、守 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≤</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\le -1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> dBTP，主流平台已收敛到约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>14</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-14</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">14</span></span></span></span></span> LUFS，无需逐平台单做。</li>\n<li>CD：硬性 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>16</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">16</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">16</span></span></span></span></span>-bit/<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>44.1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">44.1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">44.1</span></span></span></span></span> kHz，降位前必须抖动（把量化失真转为微弱噪声底），成品封为 DDP 镜像。</li>\n<li>黑胶：低频归中（防跳针）、收齿音、按内外圈位置排序、留更多动态余量；磁带交付高分辨率源并接受其饱和与高频损失。</li>\n<li>抖动只属于降位那一刻（CD），高分辨率流媒体文件不抖动；元数据见<a href=\"metadata-deliverables\">元数据与交付规范</a>，排序见<a href=\"sequencing-spacing\">序列与曲间</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"不同载体母带","id":"不同载体母带"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"流媒体：为编码留余量","id":"流媒体-为编码留余量"},{"level":2,"text":"CD：抖动与 16-bit 的硬约束","id":"cd-抖动与-16-bit-的硬约束"},{"level":2,"text":"黑胶与磁带：物理介质的脾气","id":"黑胶与磁带-物理介质的脾气"},{"level":2,"text":"从一份主版到多份成品","id":"从一份主版到多份成品"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"立体声与空间","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/mastering/spectral/stereo-space"},"next":{"title":"序列与曲间","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/mastering/delivery/sequencing-spacing"}}